    "goal": "Co-incubate CYP3A4 with UDPGA substrate in the presence of a competitive inhibitor and report the run-condition IC50 and fractional activity remaining.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of CYP3A4-mediated UDPGA conjugation. Substrate [S]=2360.4 µM, Km=1471.4 µM, competitive inhibitor Ki=175.9 µM at [I]=239.1 µM, Vmax=3.7115 µmol/min. Run-condition IC50 follows Cheng-Prusoff (IC50=Ki(1+[S]/Km)); fractional activity follows v_i/v0=[S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]). Since [S]>Km, the run-condition IC50 is inflated above the intrinsic Ki, and at [I]≈1.36×Ki the enzyme retains ~40% activity.",
